## Chat (Streaming)

Starts a chat, sends a message to the model, and receives a streaming response.

```ts
import { GoogleGenAI, Chat } from "@google/genai";

const ai = new GoogleGenAI({ apiKey: process.env.API_KEY });
const chat: Chat = ai.chats.create({
